 loomux · test · cc-hub                                         ● live   ?=help
 Keys in a conversation
   k/up           move up
   j/down         move down
   pgup/ctrl+u    page up
   pgdown/ctrl+d  page down
   g/home         go to the top
   G/end          go to the bottom
   esc            back
   a              attach to the agent
   w              watch the agent (read-only)
   o              open in the browser
   p              show the task's transcript
   x/ctrl+c       cancel the turn in flight
   y              answer yes
   n              answer no
   1-9            choose an option by its number
   r              reply with text
   ?              help
   q              quit



 esc back  q quit
